# Cloudflare Pages SPA rewrite.
#
# The Studio uses real URLs (BrowserRouter), so /results and
# /analyses/sample/report have to be served the app shell rather than 404ing.
# Without this, the site works until someone follows a deep link or presses
# refresh — which is exactly what a person does with a link you send them.
#
# 200 (rewrite), not 302 (redirect): the URL in the address bar must stay put so
# the router can read it.
/*  /index.html  200
